    614e8e2391639bef t("One conversation view for bots, PMs and task runs: messages, folded tool lines, inline pictures, question cards; a collapsible context panel on the right with timers, automations, plan checklist and swarm members (FLT-30). Tasks, results and delivery are reached from the session or its project, so they leave the rail.",Inter,14,r,align(l),lh(1.5)) p(20,44) s(fill,hug:42) ext(1648,) f[(1d4d0d39a6af65af,#E6E8EB)] "Text 43"
